cking-[0.1em] text-text-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 size-[15px] shrink-0 text-text-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg>RWAs</span><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-button border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-text-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wheat size-[15px] shrink-0 text-text-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 22 16 8"></path><path d="M3.47 12.53 5 11l1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 4.94L5 19l-1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-4.94Z"></path><path d="M7.47 8.53 9 7l1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 4.94L9 15l-1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-4.94Z"></path><path d="M11.47 4.53 13 3l1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 4.94L13 11l-1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-4.94Z"></path><path d="M20 2h2v2a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-2V6a4 4 0 0 1 4-4Z"></path><path d="M11.47 17.47 13 19l-1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.94 0L5 19l1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.94 0Z"></path><path d="M15.47 13.47 17 15l-1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.94 0L9 15l1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.94 0Z"></path><path d="M19.47 9.47 21 11l-1.53 1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.94 0L13 11l1.53-1.53a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.94 0Z"></path></svg>Commodities</span></div></div><p class="gl-lbl-dim pl-0.5 normal-case tracking-[0.05em]">routed via Jupiter · 0x · LI.FI — best quote wins, every time</p></div></div></div></div></div><p class="day-one-specstrip mx-auto mt-8 max-w-[760px] text-center">every strategy in its own <b>capped wallet</b><span class="px-2.5 text-gl-ink-4">·</span><b>non-custodial</b> — Coinbase CDP + TEE<span class="px-2.5 text-gl-ink-4">·</span><b>kill switch</b> on every screen</p><p class="mx-auto mt-4 flex max-w-[820px] flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.04em] text-gl-ink-4"><a href="https://www.coinbase.com/en-in/developer-platform/discover/case-studies/fereai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:text-text-secondary">Official Coinbase CDP partner</a><a href="https://builders.polymarket.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:text-text-secondary">Polymarket Builder</a><span>Keys never leave AWS Nitro (TEE)</span><span>Export to MetaMask or Phantom</span><span>Signing under 200ms</span></p></section><section id="connect-mcp" data-section="connect_mcp" class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-12 md:py-20 lg:px-16 border-y border-gl-line-0 bg-gl-surface-0 scroll-mt-28"><div class="flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col items-center"><div class="mb-8 w-full text-center md:mb-10"><p class="mb-3 text-micro font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-tertiary">For agents &amp; developers</p><h2 class="font-plus-jakarta text-title font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-text-primary md:text-heading lg:text-display">Use Fere inside<!-- --> <span class="genesis-gradient-text">ChatGPT &amp; Claude.</span></h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-caption text-text-secondary md:text-body-sm">Fere exposes a Model Context Protocol server. Connect any MCP client and let your own agent research and trade through Fere.</p></div><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-3 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-card border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-1 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-gl-tile text-body-sm font-bold text-text-primary">1</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plug h-4 w-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22v-5"></path><path d="M9 8V2"></path><path d="M15 8V2"></path><path d="M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-body-sm font-semibold text-text-primary md:text-body-normal">Add the connector</h3></div><p class="text-caption text-text-secondary md:text-body-sm">Copy api.fereai.xyz/mcp into Claude or ChatGPT — or any MCP client.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-card border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-1 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-gl-tile text-body-sm font-bold text-text-primary">2</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round h-4 w-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><h3 class="text-body-sm font-semibold text-text-primary md:text-body-normal">Sign in</h3></div><p class="text-caption text-text-secondary md:text-body-sm">Authorize once with OAuth. Your non-custodial wallet is provisioned automatically.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-card border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-1 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-gl-tile text-body-sm font-bold text-text-primary">3</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square h-4 w-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg><h3 class="text-body-sm font-semibold text-text-primary md:text-body-normal">Trade by chat</h3></div><p class="text-caption text-text-secondary md:text-body-sm">Research, swap, bridge, set TP/SL, and trade Polymarket — straight from your agent.</p></div></div><div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-button border border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-card p-1 pl-3"><code class="font-mono text-caption text-text-primary md:text-body-sm">https://api.fereai.xyz/mcp</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy MCP URL" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-button border border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-card px-2.5 py-1 text-caption font-semibold text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-400/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-button border border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-card px-4 py-2 text-body-sm font-semibold text-text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-400/40"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M13.827 3.52h3.603L24 20.48h-3.603l-6.57-16.96zm-7.258 0h3.767l6.57 16.96H13.3l-1.345-3.461H5.04l-1.344 3.46H0L6.569 3.52zm4.132 10.226L8.453 7.687 6.205 13.746h4.496z"></path></svg>Add to Claude</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-button border border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-card px-4 py-2 text-body-sm font-semibold text-text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-400/40"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M22.282 9.821a5.985 5.985 0 0 0-.516-4.91 6.046 6.046 0 0 0-6.51-2.9A6.065 6.065 0 0 0 4.981 4.18a5.985 5.985 0 0 0-3.998 2.9 6.046 6.046 0 0 0 .743 7.097 5.98 5.98 0 0 0 .51 4.911 6.051 6.051 0 0 0 6.515 2.9A5.985 5.985 0 0 0 13.26 24a6.056 6.056 0 0 0 5.772-4.206 5.99 5.99 0 0 0 3.997-2.9 6.056 6.056 0 0 0-.747-7.073zM13.26 22.43a4.476 4.476 0 0 1-2.876-1.04l.142-.08 4.778-2.758a.795.795 0 0 0 .393-.681v-6.737l2.02 1.168a.071.071 0 0 1 .038.052v5.583a4.504 4.504 0 0 1-4.494 4.494zM3.6 18.304a4.47 4.47 0 0 1-.535-3.014l.142.085 4.783 2.759a.771.771 0 0 0 .78 0l5.843-3.369v2.332a.08.08 0 0 1-.033.062l-4.84 2.795a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.14-1.65zM2.34 7.896a4.485 4.485 0 0 1 2.366-1.973V11.6a.766.766 0 0 0 .388.676l5.815 3.355-2.02 1.168a.076.076 0 0 1-.071 0l-4.83-2.786A4.504 4.504 0 0 1 2.34 7.872zm16.597 3.855l-5.833-3.387L15.119 7.2a.076.076 0 0 1 .071 0l4.83 2.791a4.494 4.494 0 0 1-.676 8.105v-5.678a.79.79 0 0 0-.407-.667zm2.01-3.023l-.142-.085-4.774-2.782a.776.776 0 0 0-.785 0L9.409 9.23V6.897a.066.066 0 0 1 .028-.061l4.83-2.787a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 6.68 4.66zM8.305 12.863l-2.02-1.164a.08.08 0 0 1-.038-.057V6.075a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.375-3.453l-.142.08L8.704 5.46a.795.795 0 0 0-.393.681zm1.097-2.365l2.602-1.5 2.607 1.5v2.999l-2.597 1.5-2.607-1.5z"></path></svg>Add to ChatGPT</button></div><p class="mt-3 text-caption text-text-tertiary">Copies the URL, then opens the connector settings. Also works in Cursor, Hermes Agent, or any MCP client.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><a href="/mcp" class="text-caption font-semibold text-text-secondary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">MCP landing page →</a><a href="https://api.fereai.xyz/skill.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-caption font-semibold text-text-secondary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Read the skill file →</a></div></div></section><section id="stream" data-section="stream" class="scroll-mt-28 py-11 lg:py-16"><div class="mx-auto mb-5 w-full max-w-[1320px] px-4 md:px-8"><div class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3.5"><h2 class="day-one-h-sec">Never start from a blank page.</h2><span class="flex-1"></span><span class="gl-lbl">live</span></div><p class="day-one-body mb-5">Fere reads traders, desks and forums all day and compiles what it finds into strategies you can run, fork, or blend — every one credited to its source. Tap a card to start from that sentence.</p></div><div class="day-one-stream-wall max-lg:px-4 md:max-lg:px-8"><div class="day-one-stream-track"><a aria-label="Run this: Long HYPE when funding flips negative" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Long+HYPE+when+funding+flips+negative"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">X</span>@quantfeed on X · 4m</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Long HYPE when funding flips negative</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Enter on the flip, size 5% of book, cut at −2%. Best in the 8h window after the reset.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-pos">+18.4%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Volatility breakout on the 4h, ATR-scaled" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Volatility+breakout+on+the+4h%2C+ATR-scaled"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">R/</span>r/algotrading · 12m</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Volatility breakout on the 4h, ATR-scaled</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Enter when the 4h range breaks 1.5× ATR with volume; trail the stop at 1× ATR.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-pos">+12.6%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Alert on any stablecoin 30bps off peg" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Alert+on+any+stablecoin+30bps+off+peg"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">SS</span>Delphi Digest · 26m</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Alert on any stablecoin 30bps off peg</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Check six venues every 2 minutes; escalate while the drift persists.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-sm">monitor · no funds at risk · 290 copies</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Fade the gold/oil ratio at 2σ extremes" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Fade+the+gold%2Foil+ratio+at+2%CF%83+extremes"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">YT</span>Macro Desk · 40m</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Fade the gold/oil ratio at 2σ extremes</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Mean-revert the ratio when it stretches two sigmas from its 90d mean.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-neg">-3.1%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Roll basis carry into quarterly expiry" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Roll+basis+carry+into+quarterly+expiry"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">SS</span>Delta One · 1h</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Roll basis carry into quarterly expiry</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Capture the spot-futures basis, rolling 10 days before each quarterly expiry.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-pos">+6.2%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Whale scanner on any token you pick" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Whale+scanner+on+any+token+you+pick"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">FE</span>Fere Research · 1h</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Whale scanner on any token you pick</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Track the top 20 holders and ping when any of them moves size.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-sm">monitor · no funds at risk · 640 copies</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: SOL momentum in the hour after unlocks" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=SOL+momentum+in+the+hour+after+unlocks"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">DC</span>Alpha Pit · 2h</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">SOL momentum in the hour after unlocks</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Ride the first hour of post-unlock flow with a tight trailing stop.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-pos">+5.3%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: DCA that steps aside from falling knives" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=DCA+that+steps+aside+from+falling+knives"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">FE</span>Fere Research · 3h</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">DCA that steps aside from falling knives</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">Buy $10 hourly; skip the buy when the 24h drop exceeds 8%.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-lg text-[16px] text-gl-pos">+2.4%</span><span class="gl-fig-sm">30d backtest</span></span></a><a aria-label="Run this: Ping crypto-exposed equities before earnings" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-gl-line-2 gl-surface-2 text-text-primary flex w-[330px] max-lg:w-[300px] max-lg:scroll-snap-align-start shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 p-4 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:border-gl-line-3" href="/agent?query=Ping+crypto-exposed+equities+before+earnings"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex w-fit max-w-full items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-gl-line-1 bg-gl-surface-0 py-0.5 pl-1 pr-2.5 text-[12px] text-text-secondary"><span class="inline-flex size-[17px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gl-tile font-mono text-[8.5px] text-text-tertiary">NW</span>Earnings wire · 4h</span><span class="flex-1"></span></div><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Ping crypto-exposed equities before earnings</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-text-tertiary">48h heads-up with implied-move context, straight from the filings calendar.</p><span class="mt-auto flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="gl-fig-sm">monitor · no funds at risk · 118 copies</span></span></a></div></div></section><section data-section="faq" id="faq" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1320px] px-4 py-16 md:px-8 lg:py-20"><h2 class="day-one-h-sec">Common questions</h2><dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">About Fere AI</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Fere AI is an AI-powered crypto trading and research platform that gives traders autonomous agents with non-custodial wallets to analyze markets and execute on-chain trades around the clock. It runs in the web app or inside ChatGPT and Claude via MCP.</dd></div><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Turning a sentence into a trading strategy</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Describe what you want to watch or trade in plain English. Fere compiles that description into readable rules you can inspect before anything runs, then executes them on a schedule — paper trading first, with hard position caps and a one-tap kill switch.</dd></div><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Supported chains and venues</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Scheduled strategies run on Solana, Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, BNB Chain, Polygon, and Hyperliquid. Fere also supports Polymarket prediction markets.</dd></div><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Custody of your funds</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Each agent gets its own non-custodial wallet, so you keep custody of the funds. Fere AI does not offer a fiat on-ramp.</dd></div><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Using Fere inside ChatGPT or Claude</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Fere exposes a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server at https://api.fereai.xyz/mcp, so any MCP client — including ChatGPT and Claude — can research markets and place trades through it.</dd></div><div><dt><h3 class="day-one-card-title">Pricing</h3></dt><dd class="day-one-body mt-2">Lite is $9 per month (1,100 credits), Pro is $29 per month (4,200 credits), and Whale is $99 per month (16,000 credits). Annual billing is two months free compared with paying monthly.</dd></div></dl><p class="day-one-body mt-10">Comparing Fere with other tools?<!-- --> <a class="underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:text-text-primary" href="/compare">See how Fere AI compares</a>, or<!-- --> <a class="underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-gl-state ease-gl hover:text-text-primary" href="/pricing">See the full pricing</a>.</p></section><section data-section="closer" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1320px] px-4 py-16 text-center md:px-8 lg:py-20"><h2 class="day-one-display-sm">The first strategy takes one sentence.</h2><a aria-label="Describe a strategy" class="gl-surface-3 mx-auto mt-[26px] flex w-full max-w-[560px] items-center gap-2.5 rounded-card border border-gl-line-3 p-2.5 pl-5 text-left shadow-[0_24px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]" href="/agent?query=Alert+me+when+the+USDT%2FARS+spread+passes+0.7%25"><span class="min-h-6 flex-1 overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap text-[14.5px] text-text-tertiary"><span class="ml-px inline-block h-4 w-[1.5px] translate-y-px bg-gl-ember"></span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-gl-btn-primary text-gl-on-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><p class="gl-lbl-dim mt-3.5 normal-case tracking-[0.05em]">stopping is always one tap</p><div class="mt-14 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 opacity-50 dark:hidden" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Ffere-assets%2Flogo%2Flogo-dark.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Ffere-assets%2Flogo%2Flogo-dark.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden h-4 w-4 opacity-50 dark:block" style="color:transpa